Date: Nov 18th, 2013
To: ASI, WSI
Cc: SSC, CCM, CCB, CTS, CTY, ASG/I, WSG/I, BOMBB
Fm: CCE

Re: [ISAA] Notice for Dec 1st RR Plan

Appreciate all of your endeavors on Nov 1st RR for ISAA Scope.

Recently, ISAA market is stable with average 85% of Loading factor but full=
 in weight allocation
reported by ISAA member. Plus, Nov 1st RR was partially (ard USD 50/T) impl=
emented by carriers
on voluntary and non-bidding basis especially ex N.PRC & C.PRC, however, it=
 is observed market
rates are sliding down to pre-RR level these days.

In order to protect market rate to sustainable level and push for Dec 1st R=
R reasonably & efficiently,
ISAA member lines agreed to adjust initial ISAA business plan of USD 200/T =
Dec 1st RR down to
more realist and achievable quantum of USD 100/T on a voluntary and non-bid=
ding basis.

Scope

RR Quantum (USD)

Effective Date

20=92

40=92

Ex AOTJ to IPBC destinations

USD 100

USD 200

Dec 1st 2013


It is estimated the market volume will have slight increase after slack sea=
son of Dewali festival,
Thus, pls do your best to push for Dec 1st RR by all means to boost profita=
bility of IPBC trade biz.

BTW, usually the market volume will get small peak in month end, therefore =
it is also recommended
to take any chance individually to restore our rate level before Dec 1st wh=
erever/whenever the
market allows.

Meanwhile, pls share your market intelligence with us regarding a/m RR prog=
ram, and if you do
need to mitigate the RR quantum or delay the RR implementation date, pls co=
nsult with CCE before
you making any decision.

Tks for your cooperation!

B.rgds!

Andrew Hou

CCE
Tel : 02-3770-6707
Fax : 02-2287-3353
andrew@cn.hanjin.com<mailto:andrew@cn.hanjin.com>


